00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:49.959
level
midday is about 15 minutes for blue

00:03:49.959 --> 00:03:54.519
light in the US or southern Europe and
midday on average it takes about 40

00:03:54.519 --> 00:03:58.780
minutes to get 40 joules per square
centimeter the light intensity in winter

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:08.019
is about one-third or two-thirds of the
amount in summer compared to sunlight

00:04:08.019 --> 00:04:11.650
the measurements for screen light are a
lot more variable there's a lot of

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:17.229
different screens out there there are CRT
LCD LED monitors phones and different

00:04:17.229 --> 00:04:20.709
tablets and the light they put out
