00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:42.880
so you need to get 40 joules per square
centimeter of light to get these numbers

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:45.729
from the studies and make them
comparable I had to make a bunch of

00:04:45.729 --> 00:04:49.570
assumptions so they're probably not
