00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:55.860
thousand times less damaging than the
midday Sun so is visible light from

00:05:55.860 --> 00:05:58.250
phones and computers worth worrying
about

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:03.840
for most people I would say no comparing
the amount of visible light from screens

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:08.460
to the amount from the Sun sounds really
scary but it's only scary because the

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:12.780
Sun also puts out UV which is what
causes most of the skin damage in the

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:17.040
Nambour study people who wore UV
protective sunscreen daily which had no

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:21.450
visible light protection had no
detectable increase in aging visible

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:25.260
light also hasn't been linked to any
